FigCraft (figcraft-server and the FigCraft web app)
  https://github.com/storytold/figcraft
  Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the FigCraft contributors
  MIT OR Apache-2.0
  In the image: /usr/share/doc/figcraft-server/ (LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE, NOTICE),
  /srv/web/ (LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE, NOTICE)
  The web app is compiled from FigCraft's source at the release tag, with one line of
  crates/text/build.rs changed at build time (scripts/patch-web-fonts.sh) so it embeds the
  fonts in web-fonts.txt, and one import in crates/engine/src/events.rs changed
  (scripts/patch-web-comments.sh, upstream's fix #1766) so posting a comment doesn't crash it.

static-web-server
  https://github.com/static-web-server/static-web-server
  MIT OR Apache-2.0
  In the image: /usr/share/doc/static-web-server/

Fonts embedded in the web app
  From craft-fonts (https://github.com/storytold/craft-fonts), as in FigCraft's release, and
  from Google Fonts (https://github.com/google/fonts) as listed in web-fonts.txt:
  Bodoni Moda, Jost, Parisienne. All are under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  In the image: /srv/web/OFL-<family>.txt

Base image
  gcr.io/distroless/cc-debian13 (https://github.com/GoogleContainerTools/distroless),
  Debian packages under their own licences (/usr/share/doc in the image).
